+    (pair-rail r6 P2 + r7 P1): the documented ``CEO_AUDIT_LOG_PATH`` override
+    accepts any file (``/srv/audit/current.log``), and rejecting that inherited
+    truth made a worker re-resolve the DEFAULT path — so WS-D1 watched the
